graph TD
    A[Start: Data Collection Needs] --> B[Manual Field Surveys<br/>(Forms 01A-07)]
    B --> C[Manual Encoding<br/>(Word/Excel)]
    C --> D[Barangay Dashboard Submission]
    D --> E{Content Approved?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Database Storage]
    E -- No --> G[Return to Barangay]
    F --> H[Public Access<br/>(Interactive Map)]

    style B fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:black
    style C fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:black
    
    subgraph Bottlenecks
    B
    C
    end
